en","vaulted_ceilings","groundscare","shopping"],"description":"Welcome to this spacious 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom second-floor condo for rent in the Royal Palm Bay community of Kissimmee. The home features an open-concept layout with soaring vaulted ceilings, multiple ceiling fans, and an impressive wall of windows anchored by a large arched window that fills the main living area with natural light. The kitchen opens directly to the living and dining areas and offers ample cabinet and counter space, a breakfast bar, double-basin sink, dishwasher, range, microwave, and refrigerator. The primary suite provides generous space, a private bathroom with walk-in shower, and direct access to a private balcony overlooking mature trees and greenery. Two additional bedrooms offer comfortable layouts and ample closet space, while the second full bathroom includes a tub/shower combination. Additional conveniences include interior laundry with washer and dryer, abundant storage, neutral finishes, and a functional split-bedroom layout. Residents can enjoy a wide range of community amenities, including a swimming pool, spa, tennis courts, playgrounds, recreational areas, scenic ponds, and tropical landscaping. Conveniently located near shopping, dining, major roadways, and Central Florida attractions, this rental offers a great combination of space, natural light, privacy, and community amenities. [Qualifications: 2.5x Rent in Monthly Verifiable Income, No Negative Housing Record, Pass Credit & Background Check]; 3D Virtual Tour Available Online, Video Walkthrough Available at request. Tenants must apply before being taken on Tour.","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1650,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/fe3eedc5cfadcf557278bcab7e113463l-m2194144809r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["porch","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/fe3eedc5cfadcf557278bca